Originality statement

All MoonBit source in this repository was written for this project. The OFD
package structure follows GB/T 33190-2016, which is a published national
standard; the implementation of ZIP writing, XML emission, CRC-32, TrueType
parsing and subsetting is original work. Algorithmic knowledge (CRC-32
polynomial, TrueType table layout, cmap format 4 encoding) comes from the公开
specifications of those formats, not from any single codebase.
